# Bazzite base re-pin

If the user asks to **check for base updates**, **re-pin base**, **update the Bazzite digest**, or get **newer nvidia-open / drivers from upstream**:

1. Open and follow [`docs/REPIN_BASE.md`](docs/REPIN_BASE.md) end-to-end.
2. Start with **Phase A (check only)** unless they already ordered a re-pin.
3. Never rebase machines onto `bazzite-nvidia-open` directly; never treat `just build` as a re-pin.
4. Do not push, promote `:stable`, or cut an ISO unless they ask.
